# Cross-confirm twin of lounge.script: the same route with circle and cross swapped
# (0x2000 <-> 0x4000), because with EMOTIONALSENSE_CONFIRM=cross the host's cross is the
# game's confirm. Run it with --confirm cross.
# Title -> LOUNGE -> VIDEO list, to see the collection the unlock fills.
# X leaves PLAY MODE SELECT for ARCADE/MISSION/LOUNGE/OPTION; RIGHT advances.
# The acceptance is the video counter (NN/43 with everything unlocked).
400:4000:5
460:0008:5
@1+60:0008:5
@1+200:2000:5
@1+300:0020:5
@1+360:0020:5
@1+460:0008:5
@1+700:0020:5
@1+800:4000:5
